EctoPad original iOS/iPadOS app icon, 2026-08-13

Replace the inherited Metaforce icon with an original abstract green
ectoplasm/pathogen mark. The artwork contains no Nintendo, Metroid, Metaforce,
or other third-party characters, logos, screenshots, or game assets.

Tracked source assets:

- `assets/app-icon/EctoPad-AppIcon-1024.png`
- `assets/app-icon/AppIcon60x60@2x.png`
- `assets/app-icon/AppIcon76x76@2x~ipad.png`
- `assets/app-icon/Assets.xcassets/`
- `assets/app-icon/PROVENANCE.md`

Run `scripts/sync-app-icon.sh` after bootstrapping the ignored
`ref/metaforce` checkout and before building `ios-default`. The script replaces
Metaforce's two existing loose iOS/iPadOS icon resources and recompiles its
`Assets.car` with the tracked 1024×1024 master. No Info.plist or bundle-resource
wiring changes are required because `AppIcon` and the resource filenames are
already declared by `Runtime/CMakeLists.txt` and
`Runtime/platforms/ios/Info.plist.in`.
